		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=171&amp;p=737#p737"><![CDATA[
The radio does not have a tuned RF section for that band, however from tests done by other people, the GD-77 may be usable on that band with limited power and reduced RF sensitivity<br><br>The main problem is that there is no calibration data for the power settings or more crucially the DMR deviation settings, for that band<br><br>So currently if you try to use the radio on that band, DMR would not work.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Nov 24, 2019 9:26 pm</p><hr />
